{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16103240","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16103240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1610324001:1":{"text":"So you're saying that someone stood on the center of the sundial, a strong flash of light went off, and then the person was just... gone?","source_cn":"有人站在日时仪里面，强光一闪，人就没了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D06AA7C93AC386E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610324002:1":{"text":"Yes! Yes! I saw it!","source_cn":"对对对！我们看到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A322606E550D77B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610324003:1":{"text":"Cassadee, Gervan, what do you think?","source_cn":"科丝蒂，格墨文，你们怎么看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFA341BEB5F9EC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610324004:1":{"text":"Sounds like teleportation magic.","source_cn":"嗯……听上去像是传送魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9722DA8873D0D453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610324005:1":{"text":"I was standing there just now, and nothing happened. It seems it needs a trigger of some sort for the magic to work.","source_cn":"我刚才也站在那里，什么事都发生，看来需要借助媒介启动传...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DD188D39FD9566","variant_statu